L®∫≈•˘E%1Jµ∞0∫	␀␀␀ˇˇ¬}˘Ñb/ø␀…EòQ␀␀␀ˇˇJE-∞˙ER	…W(ôR)5/%æ§¥(OâË¨YKªºâñôMk°	πây@Ks¡eKµRbAANfjJ|jJfI1®∞©Ö␀␀␀ˇˇJE/'1CYN	-X␀␀␀ˇˇ␀∂@…g␀␀,7:headers;1678:40:4:Date,29:Mon, 06 Apr 2026 13:48:24 GMT,]52:12:Content-Type,32:text/event-stream; charset=utf-8,]31:17:Transfer-Encoding,7:chunked,]28:10:Connection,10:keep-alive,]28:13:Cache-Control,8:no-cache,]52:38:anthropic-ratelimit-input-tokens-limit,7:4000000,]56:42:anthropic-ratelimit-input-tokens-remaining,7:4000000,]66:38:anthropic-ratelimit-input-tokens-reset,20:2026-04-06T13:48:24Z,]52:39:anthropic-ratelimit-output-tokens-limit,6:800000,]56:43:anthropic-ratelimit-output-tokens-remaining,6:800000,]67:39:anthropic-ratelimit-output-tokens-reset,20:2026-04-06T13:48:24Z,]45:34:anthropic-ratelimit-requests-limit,4:4000,]49:38:anthropic-ratelimit-requests-remaining,4:3999,]62:34:anthropic-ratelimit-requests-reset,20:2026-04-06T13:48:24Z,]46:32:anthropic-ratelimit-tokens-limit,7:4800000,]50:36:anthropic-ratelimit-tokens-remaining,7:4800000,]60:32:anthropic-ratelimit-tokens-reset,20:2026-04-06T13:48:24Z,]46:10:request-id,28:req_011CZnd534YZDvhKvH3f1nH7,]77:25:strict-transport-security,44:max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload,]69:25:anthropic-organization-id,36:19d39eaa-efb4-49e0-afe8-a7359703719a,]23:6:Server,10:cloudflare,]39:29:x-envoy-upstream-service-time,3:826,]27:16:Content-Encoding,4:gzip,]26:4:vary,15:Accept-Encoding,]45:13:server-timing,24:x-originResponse;dur=828,]29:15:cf-cache-status,7:DYNAMIC,]207:10:set-cookie,188:_cfuvid=ooxV.mqzmzdvRmidbNkH6uAJpLmpeTLUO1Wu5MhqKqw-1775483304.021531-1.0.1.1-_d_SbPqOhwzyVnSG6aKHb6bAsJPz2m2OuiisAQUqwAI; HttpOnly; SameSite=None; Secure; Path=/; Domain=api.anthropic.com,]73:23:Content-Security-Policy,42:default-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none',]23:12:X-Robots-Tag,4:none,]33:6:CF-RAY,20:9e813ffa2a8f61f5-DUB,]]12:http_version;8:HTTP/1.1,}7:request;3315:4:path;22:/v1/messages?beta=true,9:authority;0:,6:scheme;5:https,6:method;4:POST,4:port;3:443#4:host;17:api.anthropic.com;13:timestamp_end;18:1775483303.9005408^15:timestamp_start;18:1775483303.8992867^8:trailers;0:~7:content;2060:{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Plan: Add French (fr) Language Support\n\n## Context\n\nIssue #3460 requests French language support in the OpenClaw UI. The UI uses a custom TypeScript i18n system (no external library) with lazy-loaded locale files under `ui/src/i18n/locales/`. Currently 6 languages are supported: `en`, `zh-CN`, `zh-TW`, `pt-BR`, `de`, `es`. Adding French requires changes to 4 files and creation of 1 new file.\n\n## Files to Modify\n\n| File | Change |\n|------|--------|\n| `ui/src/i18n/lib/types.ts` | Add `\"fr\"` to the `Locale` union type |\n| `ui/src/i18n/lib/registry.ts` | Register `fr` in `LAZY_LOCALES`, `LAZY_LOCALE_REGISTRY`, and `resolveNavigatorLocale` |\n| `ui/src/i18n/locales/en.ts` | Add `fr` key to the `languages` section |\n| `ui/src/i18n/locales/fr.ts` | **New file** ‚Äî complete French translation map |\n\n## Step-by-Step Changes\n\n### 1. `ui/src/i18n/lib/types.ts`\nAdd `\"fr\"` to the `Locale` union:\n```ts\nexport type Locale = \"en\" | \"zh-CN\" | \"zh-TW\" | \"pt-BR\" | \"de\" | \"es\" | \"fr\";\n```\n\n### 2. `ui/src/"}]}],"system":[{"type":"text","text":"x-anthropic-billing-header: cc_version=2.1.92.e65; cc_entrypoint=cli; cch=63db6;"},{"type":"text","text":"You are Claude Code, Anthropic's official CLI for Claude."},{"type":"text","text":"Generate a short kebab-case name (2-4 words) that captures the main topic of this conversation. Use lowercase words separated by hyphens. Examples: \"fix-login-bug\", \"add-auth-feature\", \"refactor-api-client\", \"debug-test-failures\". Return JSON with a \"name\" field."}],"tools":[],"metadata":{"user_id":"{\"device_id\":\"20ee6186e278bc5d5a300a3de33bfb8cbb756cee46e6012016d43acea591404c\",\"account_uuid\":\"\",\"session_id\":\"5d91c901-f1cd-41a3-a6eb-f44b103432c0\"}"},"max_tokens":32000,"temperature":1,"output_config":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string"}},"required":["name"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"stream":true},7:headers;981:29:6:Accept,16:application/json,]31:13:Authorization,10:[REDACTED],]36:12:Content-Type,16:application/json,]51:10:User-Agent,33:claude-cli/2.1.92 (external, cli),]68:24:X-Claude-Code-Session-Id,36:5d91c901-f1cd-41a3-a6eb-f44b103432c0,]28:16:X-Stainless-Arch,5:arm64,]25:16:X-Stainless-Lang,2:js,]26:14:X-Stainless-OS,5:Linux,]40:27:X-Stainless-Package-Version,6:0.80.0,]31:23:X-Stainless-Retry-Count,1:0,]30:19:X-Stainless-Runtime,4:node,]41:27:X-Stainless-Runtime-Version,7:v24.3.0,]29:19:X-Stainless-Timeout,3:600,]173:14:anthropic-beta,150:interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14,redact-thinking-2026-02-12,context-management-2025-06-27,prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05,structured-outputs-2025-12-15,]52:41:anthropic-dangerous-direct-browser-access,4:true,]35:17:anthropic-version,10:2023-06-01,]26:9:x-api-key,10:[REDACTED],]14:5:x-app,3:cli,]28:10:Connection,10:keep-alive,]28:4:Host,17:api.anthropic.com,]46:15:Accept-Encoding,23:gzip, deflate, br, zstd,]25:14:Content-Length,4:2060,]]12:http_version;8:HTTP/1.1,}6:backup;0:~17:timestamp_created;16:1775483303.89973^7:comment;0:;8:metadata;0:}6:marked;0:;9:is_replay;0:~11:intercepted;5:false!11:server_conn;4099:3:via;0:~19:timestamp_tcp_setup;18:1775483194.9050496^7:address;27:17:api.anthropic.com;3:443#]19:timestamp_tls_setup;16:1775483194.96472^13:timestamp_end;0:~15:timestamp_start;18:1775483194.8467126^3:sni;17:api.anthropic.com;11:tls_version;7:TLSv1.3;11:cipher_list;0:]6:cipher;22:TLS_AES_256_GCM_SHA384;11:alpn_offers;0:]4:alpn;0:,16:certificate_list;3569:1318:-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----
