k est requise.\",\n      webhookUrlInvalid: \"L'URL du webhook doit commencer par http:// ou https://.\",\n      invalidRunTime: \"Heure d'ex√©cution invalide.\",\n      invalidIntervalAmount: \"Montant d'intervalle invalide.\",\n      cronExprRequiredShort: \"Expression Cron requise.\",\n      invalidStaggerAmount: \"Montant d'√©chelonnement invalide.\",\n      systemEventTextRequired: \"Texte d'√©v√©nement syst√®me requis.\",\n      agentMessageRequiredShort: \"Message de l'agent requis.\",\n      nameRequiredShort: \"Nom requis.\",\n    },\n  },\n};\n"}}]},{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TEnfwfH6JAEmtw9wPA4tKG","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /workspace/ui/src/i18n/locales/fr.ts"}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now run the tests to verify everything passes:"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01M5X4vTZ7rJ6jatMZfUMmFc","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"pnpm test -- ui/src/i18n/test/translate.test.ts 2>&1","description":"Run i18n tests","timeout":60000}}]},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","content":"Exit code 254\n‚ÄâWARN‚Äâ Unsupported engine: wanted: {\"node\":\">=22.16.0\"} (current: {\"node\":\"v20.20.2\",\"pnpm\":\"10.23.0\"})\n\n> openclaw@2026.3.14 test /workspace\n> node scripts/test-parallel.mjs -- ui/src/i18n/test/translate.test.ts\n\n‚ÄâWARN‚Äâ Unsupported engine: wanted: {\"node\":\">=22.16.0\"} (current: {\"node\":\"v20.20.2\",\"pnpm\":\"10.23.0\"})\n‚ÄâWARN‚Äâ Unsupported engine: wanted: {\"node\":\">=22.16.0\"} (current: {\"node\":\"v20.20.2\",\"pnpm\":\"10.23.0\"})\nundefined\n‚ÄâERR_PNPM_RECURSIVE_EXEC_FIRST_FAIL‚Äâ Command \"vitest\" not found\n\nDid you mean \"pnpm test\"?\n‚ÄâELIFECYCLE‚Äâ Test failed. See above for more details.\n‚ÄâWARN‚Äâ  Local package.json exists, but node_modules missing, did you mean to install?\n\n<system-reminder>\nThe task tools haven't been used recently. If you're working on tasks that would benefit from tracking progress, consider u